3. COMPONENTS THAT ARE NOT PART OF THIS WORK

Aura is an optional component of the Analyst Toolkit (ATK) and a separate
work held in its own repository. ATK is governed by its
own terms, and nothing above grants any right in it.

This software contains no third-party code and depends on nothing outside the
Python standard library; it can optionally use tinytag (MIT licence) to read
audio tags, and FFmpeg as a separate program to measure loudness. Any third-party software used alongside it remains
governed by its own licence terms, and nothing above modifies, restricts or
claims any right in any of it.


